"For normal GPS only operation, ArduPilot’s GPS parameter defaults will work "
"for any serial port configured for ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5. To set up "
"simpleRTK2B Budget receiver to use with ArduPilot, we have prepared several "
"tutorials:"
