"`Configuration tutorial: simpleRTK2B Budget (u-blox ZED-F9P) and ArduPilot. "
"<https://www.ardusimple.com/how-to-configure-simplertk2b-basic-starter-kit-"
"zed-f9p-module-and-connect-it-to-ardupilot-to-get-centimeter-accurate-gps-"
"location/>`_"
